# showLink(Player player)
# Bind to a button/sign at the hub. Prints the RYmaphub web address as a
# clickable chat link, plus a copy-to-clipboard button for anyone playing
# on a machine where the browser will not open from the game.
#
# Text components use the 1.21.5+ shape: `click_event`/`hover_event` rather
# than `clickEvent`/`hoverEvent`, and `open_url` carries `url` rather than
# `value`. On an older server rename those four fields and put the address
# back under "value".

@using rymaphub
@fast

@player
@player &#936be5&lRY's Map Hub
@player &#d4d4d4● Build your map art on the web page, then paste
@player &#d4d4d4  the messages it gives you into chat here.
@player
@bypass tellraw {{player}} ["",{"text":"  ","color":"#d4d4d4"},{"text":"rysanders18.github.io/rymaphub","color":"#936be5","bold":true,"underlined":true,"click_event":{"action":"open_url","url":"https://rysanders18.github.io/rymaphub/"},"hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":[{"text":"Click to open in your browser","color":"#a1a1a1"}]}}]
@player
@bypass playsound minecraft:block.note_block.harp master {{player}} ~ ~ ~ 1 1.5
